OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FBreezy with
OL,6,Fshowers, mostly across the Peak
OL,7,FDistrict, clear elsewhere. Clouding
OL,8,Fover later, with light rain across
OL,9,Fwestern parts by Monday morning. The
OL,10,Fwind gradually eases to a gentle
OL,11,Fbreeze.
OL,12,
OL,13,CMonday:FRain moves northeast during
OL,14,Fthe morning and clears by mid-
OL,15,Fafternoon. It stays dry but cloudy for
OL,16,Fthe rest of the day, with the wind
OL,17,Fstrengthening once more.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
