OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:
OL,6,FShowers soon clear to give sunny
OL,7,Fspells, but it stays breezy on
OL,8,FTuesday. Breezy with showers on
OL,9,FWednesday. Foggy Thursday morning,
OL,10,Fbrighter later, with lighter winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
